{"id":"728ff257684515d2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-henkin-sentence-modal.md","title":"Henkin Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","display":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","aliases":["89-df-henkin-sentence-modal"],"display":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-henkin-sentence-modal — Henkin Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为模态化公式的弱不动点集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为下文定义的 Henkin 类；在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的上下文中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是其旧记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal H_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal H_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104–105；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 不含被消去的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\((H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 现在是显式类参数，旧记号只能在已固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 时引用。此处给类定义，不预设成员已经存在。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 模态化，故弱条件与原书加强条件等价。\n算术实现下得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*\">\\(H^*\\)</span> 与自身可证性之间的可证等价。进一步的可证性来自 Löb 规则，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93f1683ca340f61b\" href=\"?note=93f1683ca340f61b\" title=\"89-cor-henkin-provable\">89-cor-henkin-provable</a>；具体代表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b66c5788afda7d6d\" href=\"?note=b66c5788afda7d6d\" title=\"89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-cor-henkin-provable","status":"resolved","id":"93f1683ca340f61b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"成员 $H$ 不含被消去的 $p$，且 $(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。$p$ 现在是显式类参数，旧记号只能在已固定 $p$ 时引用。此处给类定义，不预设成员已经存在。$\\Box p$ 模态化，故弱条件与原书加强条件等价。\n算术实现下得到 $H^*$ 与自身可证性之间的可证等价。进一步的可证性来自 Löb 规则，见 [[89-cor-henkin-provable]]；具体代表为 $\\top$，见 [[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"b66c5788afda7d6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"成员 $H$ 不含被消去的 $p$，且 $(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。$p$ 现在是显式类参数，旧记号只能在已固定 $p$ 时引用。此处给类定义，不预设成员已经存在。$\\Box p$ 模态化，故弱条件与原书加强条件等价。\n算术实现下得到 $H^*$ 与自身可证性之间的可证等价。进一步的可证性来自 Löb 规则，见 [[89-cor-henkin-provable]]；具体代表为 $\\top$，见 [[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal H_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}.","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"H^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1448,"backlinks":[{"id":"93f1683ca340f61b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b66c5788afda7d6d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-12